ShortDescription: Lets your AI apps send texts from your own phone, with your approval.
Description: |-
  Pocketwire Bridge runs in the background with an icon in the tray and connects this computer
  to Pocketwire. AI apps connect to Pocketwire at one address and ask to send a text; with your
  approval, Pocketwire passes it to the Bridge, which sends it from your Android phone through
  KDE Connect. The Pocketwire server stores the number and the text, so it can queue texts while
  this computer is offline and show their history.
